    "text": "MaxPreps\nwebsite\nWilliamsburg\nBaseball Recap: Williamsburg Comes Up Short\nBy Team Reports,\n1 days agoWilliamsburg was not able to break out of their rough patch on Thursday as the team picked up their fourth straight loss. They fell 8-5 to the Grinnell Tigers. If the Raiders were looking for revenge after losing 9-1 to the Tigers when the teams met back in June of 2024, then they'll just have to keep looking.",
